OL,3,GNEWSASuspended sentence for HGV driver
OL,4,Aover teen's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver who killed a teenage
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist at a roundabout has been
OL,8,Fhanded a suspended jail sentence.
OL,10,FZebedee Watson, 17, from north Dorset,
OL,11,Fwas waiting to enter Safety Drive
OL,12,FRoundabout in Poole on 28 November 2025
OL,13,Fwhen he was run over from behind,
OL,14,FWeymouth Magistrates' Court heard.
OL,16,FPaul Graham, 56, from Stoborough,
OL,17,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to causing
OL,18,Fdeath by careless driving.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
